        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 space-y-1">
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">PolicyNest Insurance Brokers Pvt. Ltd.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500">requests access to your issued documents:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 pt-1 space-y-0.5 text-slate-700 font-medium">
            <li>Aadhaar Card (UIDAI Offline e-KYC XML)</li>
            <li>PAN Card (Income Tax Department)</li>
